# Only the scripts are committed. Everything else here is the runner's own: binaries from the
# release tarball, credentials (.runner, .credentials*), .env/.path, the job workspace (_work/,
# a full clone of this repo) and the logs (_logs/, _diag/). `runner.sh uninstall` deletes exactly
# this set with `git clean -X`, so keep this file and that command in agreement.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/runner.sh
!/hooks/
